#: scenario7:scenario7_A96CAE13_9C7E_4730_98AB_0871D301A47C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7a6b094a53af8973bde33384b510bf4c23c5e9162b6dc81681fb99f14e56c1a1
#. default-sha256: 074108a748a0a285ec2ec2a73fe2fdc3dcd4d2a4e681d805c980e4bde0d92c5c
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_A96CAE13_9C7E_4730_98AB_0871D301A47C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"The next thing I know, I’m sinking into a vast void."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫어느"
"덧 ⟪k:17⟫나는―― 한 줄기 빛도 안 드는 어둠 밑바닥에 ⟪k:18⟫가라앉아 있었다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_90291295_72F6_4C51_BFC6_381BD6CEF353
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 02007efa0ab3667e8f857c80ec85ff64cbe595500e34df2a660f9ded74055bc5
#. default-sha256: 741c3906e620c750f13c613e4e212c2b6236076f3027abf10d6da1810c1b5603
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_90291295_72F6_4C51_BFC6_381BD6CEF353"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Darkness cuffs my hands and legs, restricting my movement."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫내 사지를 어둠의 손길이 옭아매어 ⟪k:1⟫꼼짝도 할 수 없었다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_2AD5BC36_5471_4DAF_8C37_9DDE094511FD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f482890405dab0afd285ced75c85ef856a9dda69ca2274dc346f71be411f73cb
#. default-sha256: db22af9c1fb99c82231d38a45ea5004f1eb32019eed1a501e5e480158f60b202
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_2AD5BC36_5471_4DAF_8C37_9DDE094511FD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Images of the past I had kept buried away for so long stream past me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫외면하던 과거의 광경이 ⟪k:1⟫내 면전에서 흘러갔다……."

#: scenario7:scenario7_BA656386_6B5A_407B_A461_559136048884
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fff44e9a89bea57567441134b872ffae66a6a16ba4a402d02dbf424637290092
#. default-sha256: 837f1b666ae522611327e4782beca4f2c93d3868a36e1d2c72274aa84df79ea2
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_BA656386_6B5A_407B_A461_559136048884"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫This isn’t how I wanted it to happen."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫이런 식으로 들통나고 싶진 않았다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_F4B7AAC7_8F40_40E8_B4DC_DAA38BFB6CEF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2eb4e1dfca5de52e6fa8ef129ec10f7db02a829c8b650d8bbf7b30ea8ba51cce
#. default-sha256: 590db8014d10a8dc7dd0ced994ca2d4b0ab31b15c88765eb7e341a9372d1b26c
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_F4B7AAC7_8F40_40E8_B4DC_DAA38BFB6CEF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Not coming from my own mouth, but being laid bare for all to see without my consent."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫내 출생의 비밀을……, ⟪k:1⟫내 한심한 과거를……"

#: scenario7:scenario7_88540E0B_4C1F_4535_B178_8FF75C778400
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0c74aa2bfc951cc39153f7b58ba453e7306799da8530a22e5893591af247843a
#. default-sha256: 3bbcb74475bd7fa555f25f20fad57a3001fa42ef2594b27a4eb016030e30a400
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_88540E0B_4C1F_4535_B178_8FF75C778400"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫That wasn’t how I wanted her to find out about my secret.⟪k:1⟫About my shameful history."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫내 입으로 고백하는 게 아니라…… 폭로당하는 식으로……⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫지젤이…… 알기 바라진 않았다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_011499B5_A734_4A7F_BADA_EECA71EE1258
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a00498c46aae296d23ca91c404f3fec6103a2a3d62b1f6735ecce923d306ee8b
#. default-sha256: cad0d8f4b2e1bb8a8b493dc99f1c9abd01132db7801d5de51142d3714d05fee5
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_011499B5_A734_4A7F_BADA_EECA71EE1258"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I warned you, my dear.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I told you you didn’t want to reclaim your old self."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그러게 제가 뭐랬어요.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫당신은 자기 자신을 되찾아선 안 된댔죠."

#: scenario7:scenario7_DF7DD3A0_BC0F_4C5C_B3F1_B44B778C1EB2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d1295171688bf80b1a81eeb48c4817f2a1d400e884bee2da0fae521265b8e422
#. default-sha256: 1a998f8aff37b103fb126761bacbe3e0531fb97be65f08226dc20d982ba7d4a2
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_DF7DD3A0_BC0F_4C5C_B3F1_B44B778C1EB2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫If you had simply let it be, you wouldn’t be here now, forced to relive it all."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫잃은 채로 있었으면 ⟪k:1⟫이토록 힘겨운 과거와…… 직면할 필요는 없었어요."

#: scenario7:scenario7_26AA5245_B7EF_4A45_A834_0B33AE52C6D2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2fe102ebd9d2791a0f7f06a25127360d7f7af284450d424a65be840bdcf9d5f5
#. default-sha256: a2ea87d79cb17f469284ab2927c8831ad1b1508dd60575f4e3157b99082077d9
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_26AA5245_B7EF_4A45_A834_0B33AE52C6D2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Now do you understand?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The tale I spun behind the fourth door...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫was as "
"much for you as it was for her."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫이제 아시겠죠?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫제가 만든 네 번째 이야기는…… ⟪k:3⟫당신을 위한 거기도 했어요."

#: scenario7:scenario7_549F9556_6FFA_41FE_A2D5_02D9825633E8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6fcebede583c9f24955e85c6041b35e1e28a7c2e145c527fc4a789cefb646f82
#. default-sha256: 981f5692152b00426b4362fbf382073348a7a4129993c10738bdafc06c3175e3
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_549F9556_6FFA_41FE_A2D5_02D9825633E8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫There, you were a young man with a sad fate,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그 세계 안에서 ⟪k:1⟫당신은 슬픈 운명을 짊어진 남자였지만――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_81DF8018_C7B1_483D_A0A1_1FAD77647BF9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7461724991a7346ad99f7e93386f9530f759ad56d532a0736c0eae805af39f04
#. default-sha256: 16b7717f9edbe64fcd0cf1decd75bb86d118dafd327e2c74da5d676fb4838049
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_81DF8018_C7B1_483D_A0A1_1FAD77647BF9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but you met a wonderful woman, fell in love with her,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫마음씨 고운 여자와 사랑을 나누어――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_782DC1D8_EFC8_40C7_A723_4689DB8A74F3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 26ecb449c20ea9a59579b415e1f67f42e56317d94063a0ef6a51473c30d9d8ea
#. default-sha256: 1237dcd841f96c0a9db26ae7c912d5a1149d3fd7e6813ffe3171e9b4027f0043
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_782DC1D8_EFC8_40C7_A723_4689DB8A74F3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and then died in the arms of tragedy."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫비극 속에서 ⟪k:1⟫목숨을 잃었죠……."

#: scenario7:scenario7_6A27B7F1_BF1F_48E8_9185_3B6D50AA5242
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bd676b70ed49c64d87afb992a9ab4fdd29ef8b981d42c9ac2a9bdb9444d7a92e
#. default-sha256: 964591e88a59352530676977a88e27292a0da264e211bdba937077b306edd6a9
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_6A27B7F1_BF1F_48E8_9185_3B6D50AA5242"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The sequence of events is not far from the truth, but I was able to turn it into something "
"enchanting and beautiful."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫당신의 진실과 흐름이 바뀌지 않은 채, ⟪k:1⟫아주 신비롭고 아름다운 이야기가 되었잖아요."

#: scenario7:scenario7_7DAC9D9F_91D2_4E0A_B9B9_ACA1FDE69FA2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5c293cafc397dcf9b669e28d4a4ccff61db53e33294b323dcb42e186a1f99278
#. default-sha256: 3eef6fba94b6dee6028722de5059d8cdc9f25a2ab42c3ae34accce3fa9893725
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_7DAC9D9F_91D2_4E0A_B9B9_ACA1FDE69FA2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I got rid of all the nasty little details—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그 육체의 비밀과 ⟪k:1⟫당신의 추악함, ⟪k:2⟫현실미 있는 건 무엇 하나――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_7AFC74F4_8115_4B73_ACB9_19516C6C1639
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8e47079d9659681f987453114a21ed109c84e54b1a64a35920b9d258de4606f4
#. default-sha256: 898e6aacf2d2016f2bbc6ceb41838af30b19038a7ff72ae304efe3e659e18875
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_7AFC74F4_8115_4B73_ACB9_19516C6C1639"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫your ugliness, your body troubles, all of that."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그 안에는 없었잖아요."

#: scenario7:scenario7_6FB89264_E5E1_4041_82F0_CEEEB885144B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0f68a5a048f6eced56f49296564a0cce8489ee6a36dfcc6ae8860c05d227c751
