#: scenario7:scenario7_BAD10D96_D417_483D_9190_93974B5C73A8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 26d4b32c03079d7f48d6b2b51f5176a9b4daaa46cdd6b4e08845dbf654058b95
#. default-sha256: 14a67da5d8c94bb024329a439338e0fbb00ae5646943acfab95c3bc502a831e7
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_BAD10D96_D417_483D_9190_93974B5C73A8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You were afraid she wouldn’t accept you, were you not?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫―――지젤의 거절이 두려우셨죠?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_1078AA23_182D_43D3_9C56_21BE25236266
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
