msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫I couldn’t remember how long it had been since the capital had disappeared into the "
"distance, but I’d been on the road for some time now."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫수도 성벽이 시야에서 사라진 것도 ⟪k:19⟫며칠 전 일이었으며――⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫마차는 그 후로 ⟪k:22⟫"
"꾸준히 달렸다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_ABDA3FD6_2F53_4B77_8D55_365B3A717DC8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6e07075f7d49be4bbdb72bcf25a27417177d6a2ee255ef3d94433087a3628370
#. default-sha256: 446dad199d25f5b957e7bf20627a74356ff64e6dbd72b11ce4c33b440c4222b8
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_ABDA3FD6_2F53_4B77_8D55_365B3A717DC8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫We’d long since left paved roads behind. The carriage rocked back and forth as it proceeded "
"down the rough dirt path."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫포장도 거의 안 된 흙길은 ⟪k:1⟫마차를 좌우로 흔들었다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_F0C6902E_68FE_4483_BBB0_C7DD7DF9C42B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 10fe69fb51afdfea7953cac0eca96091efff712a94d7b2dd8012439d6ebe00f1
#. default-sha256: bded18734b3cea86be659ebfdb3a9822a16a63db45575b5428cf73dd73164f60
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_F0C6902E_68FE_4483_BBB0_C7DD7DF9C42B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫For hours, I stared through the window as unfamiliar scenery flowed past."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫나는 내내 ⟪k:1⟫낯선 경치를 보기만 했다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_79A48CB2_9C49_44A6_B40B_44E15C9C445D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1459d02476e5e279f3797a3803e83381baf8ac9a9ca3a8ce965c0c97b5877a86
#. default-sha256: 57c34325d2d9bc8b1f636ea1bdde9f70bbcd570242973b0842f6f20698fffa09
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_79A48CB2_9C49_44A6_B40B_44E15C9C445D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Eventually, a fog settled over the area, making it difficult to discern night from day."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그러다 안개가 껴서―― ⟪k:1⟫세계의 명암을 모호하게 만들었다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_0E088A47_52C1_4581_B41B_BF40C33F08E2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4f00609e78f8c471172a84eb8db7a576464125cd0948bfb4cf98be6fd5182e9e
#. default-sha256: f14d6d7014276f2cfd29b857810a7aed7628e3fefaf62411a468449e738c9fa3
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_0E088A47_52C1_4581_B41B_BF40C33F08E2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫We made our way through dark, dense woods,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫암녹빛이 우거진 어둠의 숲을 지나자――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_359143BE_5C80_42FC_B167_2C23C3273733
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 09c52fce3d55bda1cfa1026bd08a92e4f56c99447b0c511e150a96c2f608aeae
#. default-sha256: a0feeee0dd88274048462ef649b3ff3290a9ac57e939bee6d6804ccf4bcd8bac
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_359143BE_5C80_42FC_B167_2C23C3273733"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫and beyond them, like the world fading into view after a dream,⟪k:1⟫a mansion appeared "
"before us."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그 저택이 ⟪k:1⟫잠에서 깨어 마주하듯 홀연히 나타났다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_DC8ACA79_CAB1_4942_82B7_958A94631B2D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8efd0fe299200cc720e39939f0ed3f1c1d804f434bf1b2941888e4188f27edb8
#. default-sha256: 1e1992a9b6ef3e04e033e04eb291977efb1d63610880abfa55057c78a4bcfc6d
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_DC8ACA79_CAB1_4942_82B7_958A94631B2D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫All the windows were either shuttered or boarded, encasing the house in darkness. "
"⟪k:3⟫In a way, it felt like all I had done was move from one prison to a much larger one."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫모든 창문이 덧문과 판자로 폐쇄된 ⟪k:3⟫캄캄한 저택…….⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫그건 친가의 유폐 생활"
"을 방불케 했다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_07AD7681_D31A_46C2_A2B1_605FBAB4690C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eb29f5f29d1435e9a53f0c871e49a93564d9878c26f7bdfb72dadaf01f907b21
#. default-sha256: 053b527bb11882292ac1534175d26b0720bcf2f71d53cd6ed6f3505a98d8320e
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_07AD7681_D31A_46C2_A2B1_605FBAB4690C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Briefly, I thought they had possibly been sealed to keep anyone from seeing me inside, but "
"my coming here was a very recent development."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫내 모습을 노출시키지 않으려고 ⟪k:1⟫창문을 막은 건가 싶었지만――, 내가 오는 건 최근에야 정해진 "
"일이다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_09D5BBD6_AEEE_44A9_A23E_95B5BEA18C65
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7995f55f2c512a9fbc2279dce6ba0acd19aa8536e07bddb491b1ab90b36583fd
#. default-sha256: 72631ede8e17ae73392ce2bc3956d0f936c505989fc67bae4fd37461c04d5aee
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_09D5BBD6_AEEE_44A9_A23E_95B5BEA18C65"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫More likely, then, the house had been in this condition when it was initially purchased."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그렇다면 ⟪k:1⟫이 저택은 처음부터 이랬으리라.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫아마도 사들였을 때부터……."

#: scenario7:scenario7_E5FACC8E_63AE_45FE_84F5_08E44CF718B3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bdb79285590c1244b975e503d4e70fa540cc9c4d88b30b7daddaa35b270524f6
#. default-sha256: ecb630141f49f4d17e914709307f8a7065b9b373faffb0f0cda4ac3b00d03b95
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_E5FACC8E_63AE_45FE_84F5_08E44CF718B3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Quite the piece of property my father had found himself with.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I wondered if he had "
"been swindled by its previous owner."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫별 괴상한 저택을 사들였구나 ⟪k:1⟫싶었다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫아버지는 중개인에게 속은 걸 수도 있겠다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_10E4132C_00D0_407E_BB98_0B0A7C2D8AAB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 64da733ed143f0b7374e5919aa28ed1990b19ee73147290b6e07977f8f5c7bcc
#. default-sha256: 1228db85692faf117fc260f52bf8a9a421dd45cc3431a418ea63954281e63985
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_10E4132C_00D0_407E_BB98_0B0A7C2D8AAB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was a gloomy, uninviting place, but it didn’t appear to be in disrepair."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫접근하기도 꺼려지게 음울한 기척을 풍기는 저택이었지만, ⟪k:1⟫외벽은 일단 수복되어 ⟪k:2⟫완전히 "
"폐허까진 아니었다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_A61028F2_141A_4513_ADDB_0512E02AD2E5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f8031baac6ebb9014981a27a26ff1c5c67476deecb85c771b7d722649ad862b5
#. default-sha256: b59b4fa65e4a85011781d767555a206542e023128f72b6f8d7bdc95d09a5fa2d
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_A61028F2_141A_4513_ADDB_0512E02AD2E5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The coachman left my luggage outside the door, gave me an empty farewell, and then went "
"on his way."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫마부는 나와 짐을 저택 입구에 둔 후, ⟪k:2⟫형식상으로나마 인사를 하고 떠났다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_3DC55A11_A712_4E8A_8838_C3E23C0B0603
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4df497785db0864249667094a96f31c0deb20fc3e133c43e4468adb2b250a5f0
#. default-sha256: 9d617bc8c603360647a6b2c0dc5347d4428aa57e81e6044a031a3d1c93644133
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_3DC55A11_A712_4E8A_8838_C3E23C0B0603"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I was... ⟪k:1⟫entirely alone."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫나는 완전히…… 혼자가 되었다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_482E3049_2539_49D9_B7CA_842612330E9C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b8454e9d74eab7cf9d350a99348dcfc2288bcfff0a1cc493e597b0374b28fbc1
#. default-sha256: 31b54adc12e8b28c98d65600e59c1d439b16301d3d9228e49b6b12fab27675af
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_482E3049_2539_49D9_B7CA_842612330E9C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………."

#: scenario7:scenario7_A85997A7_0A43_4642_A58B_D0231ACAB0AB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dcbde44f34fda1f13879605e615bf4173cb383c7c74ea969e3ae0282623bc939
#. default-sha256: fea5e26d10af112ede7c6a62ec59db144f5ac5c1608f15e4242fc18a1104bf27
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_A85997A7_0A43_4642_A58B_D0231ACAB0AB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I spent some time just staring out at the forest, but naturally, there was nothing of "
"interest to be found there. ⟪k:1⟫So I quietly turned around and opened the door to the mansion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫잠시 숲을 바라보았지만――, ⟪k:1⟫그런들 뭐가 바뀌지도 않는다. ⟪k:2⟫나는 아무 말 없이…… 저택 문"
"을 열었다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_1F5B5544_F2BD_4AE1_B168_AD9BCD0A2CC4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6e47821fdaa7c1c0dc5023d2e99862fb2e9234b43779f97b99ad519901e9ba94
#. default-sha256: 287b174f5a219341ee439f5af0c6553c728eaaf148416b5f062130fcbfb1e634
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_1F5B5544_F2BD_4AE1_B168_AD9BCD0A2CC4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫It’s certainly dark..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫어두운데………."

#: scenario7:scenario7_A39B9906_8B03_44F8_9562_BC3F44C5F944
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 28cd8514dbd87276485fd8743c777cf4b8a904a91ae82521e1c536789f199dab
#. default-sha256: 4d30a420402d2bad004a2d6c59853c57b8e44bf2bab6eff9f7b28302de4e2d38
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_A39B9906_8B03_44F8_9562_BC3F44C5F944"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I could barely even see my own feet."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫발밑도 확인하기 힘든 어둠이 ⟪k:1⟫저택을 장악하고 있었다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_FA3122C7_CEF1_4641_81FC_8FC5C9F108D4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 08ad3d8d1d90f9fdddaefea935ac192694a186aade8e0a91d4a87bbb3e51d58e
#. default-sha256: e7dfaa26279e72031144606662dced88d3d739ee71fb8cad11db7371ff87fc38
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_FA3122C7_CEF1_4641_81FC_8FC5C9F108D4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Briefly, I considered trying to unshutter a window or two, but ended up deciding against it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫덧문이라도 좀 열어 볼지 고민하다가, ⟪k:1⟫그냥 두기로 했다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_6F10B502_63D0_40A0_A785_24C01EE28C1D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f413b8ff37f8816c42d16d6135729d914e91854993d95bc62c9c959e5439f8fc
#. default-sha256: 503866bfd150fa392e129d7a4e972bc2bebd8620714072e6460c23d093c6f164
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_6F10B502_63D0_40A0_A785_24C01EE28C1D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The less inviting the place looked, the easier it would be for me to avoid contact with the "
"outside world, as Didier had recommended."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫저택이 으스스할수록 ⟪k:1⟫나도 외부와 차단된다. ⟪k:2⟫디디에가 말한 ⟪k:3⟫남과 접촉하지 말란 충"
"고가 쉽게 지켜지는 셈이다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_B0E767C7_7129_413F_9DE2_47181008E1FC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 89899ad2634565c3bb573e0ebd9739e5ffde04085d1bf99f367cd454b0732ed6
#. default-sha256: c35596e0218c92ce9cc5c04cb19259f04ba5b66f68992ee67a16049245248485
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_B0E767C7_7129_413F_9DE2_47181008E1FC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Standing there in the darkness for several minutes, my eyes gradually grew accustomed to the "
"lack of light. ⟪k:1⟫While it was hardly ideal, it was sufficient to take a look around the house."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫어둠 속에서 가만히 있다 보니 ⟪k:1⟫눈이 적응했다. ⟪k:2⟫평소처럼 다니긴 힘들어도, ⟪k:3⟫저택 확"
"인은 가능해졌다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_9CE09A1E_68E6_4052_BB90_4836A61A2BFC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 377f5f5fc1ee75a70b3fa4592bd19da2956fa279711370e2f6f3d175752c3f41
#. default-sha256: 37d01e1b11cd4f4a52f521e2b0f328ce379d0facf27c2be19fe1cad8d8b12f38
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9CE09A1E_68E6_4052_BB90_4836A61A2BFC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The inside didn’t seem to have received the same level of care as the outside—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫"
"everything was dusty and the air was many years stale. ⟪k:3⟫But I wasn’t in a cleaning mood,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫실내까지는 청소가 안 되어서 ⟪k:1⟫먼지와 곰팡내가 독했지만, ⟪k:2⟫청소는 뒤로 미루기로 하고――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_776F7F6F_F659_4AD0_AFE7_A4C0D33DD587
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d19fbe16ab17eb6e7352113b191d23d536d54a368a628124be8353747c1d0bbb
#. default-sha256: e8d033e1fe3a1346a4e3483c1f075b7c344d48fcd263c98113ea1e380ebec489
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_776F7F6F_F659_4AD0_AFE7_A4C0D33DD587"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫so I dug through my luggage for a bundle of candles, lighting one with a flint."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫짐에서 양초를 찾아내 ⟪k:1⟫부싯돌로 불을 붙였다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_9C16AE7A_4C5F_453F_B2FF_F8ED60FD6DD4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d91744b473c76731d70c30fd5f40ec50795a87bb85d231aea115706886c051d3
