#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e25f858a2bdd2a402636789df8a34f7037e179f9f8704c446565816d6104f0e3
#. default-sha256: 696c3cd272638a3ef5b3c7ac26e972a06d97ffd8cf200909bb136ce4bf763e2a
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_B6C6D534_DC8F_429B_A553_F47721B905E0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫for others, and myself."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫나를 믿는 마음……."

#: scenario7:scenario7_BE12EC48_145F_4546_84E1_B563561CA4DF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 77ebe12d206fd0ee4cf4a4ac7d593cae5a7353a5d1691bebf1ee22b56391f938
#. default-sha256: 919551f03aae38ef662aecab44f8c52524f8c28a92c60aa64cf270e2471e2eaf
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_BE12EC48_145F_4546_84E1_B563561CA4DF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫With enough time, I started questioning my own beliefs about what I was—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫started "
"thinking that perhaps I ⟪k:3⟫was⟪k:4⟫ cursed."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫이윽고 나조차 ⟪k:1⟫나를 알 수 없어져서――⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫저주가 실제로 존재하는 듯한 착각에도 빠졌"
"다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_F37655E5_59C4_4E2B_9157_F84D014601F3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ecdc6e91c6710da656248f810ee8d97a7e075642346c550b58dab75e7216b6d4
#. default-sha256: dfc24d90b795ca2be8681eec74b061afdc080818d34605ae9aa13aa7b3021691
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_F37655E5_59C4_4E2B_9157_F84D014601F3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Much like they had at the Bollinger estate, the servant who came by every month did his best "
"to avoid making eye contact."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫정기적으로 오는 고용인은 ⟪k:1⟫아니나 다를까, ⟪k:2⟫나와 눈을 맞추지 않았다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_029E45AA_44BE_458F_BDF4_437FF4559F7F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 39100951a69295f7ca884f082059e60a568e0cbf3a437770de33f69c50598be5
#. default-sha256: b2e69e544197b18ab308c00f1fe4f9751820ea79ba825c0bea9eabe8473e65f6
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_029E45AA_44BE_458F_BDF4_437FF4559F7F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But beyond just bringing me food, he was also checking in on me—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫and making "
"sure I didn’t attempt to run away."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그 사람은 ⟪k:1⟫식량 운반에 더해―― 내가 저택에서 도주를 꾀하진 않을지, ⟪k:2⟫내 모습이 어떤지 "
"여부를 ⟪k:3⟫확인했다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_044BC60E_46C3_4781_A997_FF699469C441
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 07b9bd2d29269cd8e5f7eefd8b1268bbb7d5b2014cb3a719da9b98306f67c076
#. default-sha256: 734f466bb1f7b1843b3283cdd30b0ecea880b19f8cd7e2498ad9a5193ba8026c
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_044BC60E_46C3_4781_A997_FF699469C441"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And every month, he probably went back and told Mother the same thing:"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그 후에 아마도―― 어머니에게 매번 이렇게 전했으리라."

#: scenario7:scenario7_17190076_4B55_4F0C_9E79_2119779C385C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cc094745ca8a3476366fa6b52eb6a60ebc2dd7ee2011be3eb54c8d9a8ff7d664
#. default-sha256: 95c90ae9c502116033531f160317029d45b7e12dc68570c05cabbf3618bac07a
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_17190076_4B55_4F0C_9E79_2119779C385C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫that my curse had still not been broken."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫저주는 풀리지 않았다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_6FFD889F_1082_4B20_9317_DDE4F07485F4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0eadb2c935f9de0abd52f172bc09f12f57c4557d7957b71447a02d99fdb2b716
#. default-sha256: 731703931139e046f0269aae753a45fa5d06f23346e06ce39aed045b868c0467
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_6FFD889F_1082_4B20_9317_DDE4F07485F4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Do you have the answers I seek... ⟪k:5⟫O Father in Heaven?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫……신이여……, ⟪k:5⟫당신은 모든 답을 압니까……?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_7FDDCA06_7179_4583_915D_98E97CFE61A4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1936333557947d3bf24c0913e22b471603e3f443a4cf1c81d9b681ebb3d3a2b1
#. default-sha256: 952301e3a9827c5f2e418e5abf3967e165b8d43eadb81a8863940c7967c8405a
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_7FDDCA06_7179_4583_915D_98E97CFE61A4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫If you do... ⟪k:1⟫I ask of you to guide me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫안다면…… ⟪k:1⟫알려 주십시오……."

#: scenario7:scenario7_B3CB0E49_4123_4A2C_8FF9_AACED4FCA3DD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1a55e553771d6c7ec626220ba8a7185c36ece94b1377d3617df3cb586f64093e
#. default-sha256: ca8601008b7ed6a6e488f7e0e29d6e87ef0f68d11cd307ec33eef6d8eb9e1109
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_B3CB0E49_4123_4A2C_8FF9_AACED4FCA3DD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫To please tell me what I am..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫제가 누구인지……."

#: scenario7:scenario7_6858B302_A59E_4CA5_ABC1_BA1B62686BE5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3b6e136b7c55754177026cf626870ab6c4c3edbaa3ced715860a5fb026409c7c
