#: scenario7:scenario7_933BF01C_F2A4_4DAA_9DE6_EE0873D08279
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 887129deaf3dc1b2ca3dac4ece9c9135170fcbc0ce249fc66f376abc61832001
