msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_51EE7D7E_C2F2_4960_B156_BC5FD7AB4C4F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I spent enough time alone in that dark mansion to drive anyone mad."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫미치도록 긴 시간을 ⟪k:4⟫캄캄한 저택에서 보냈다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_728DAE21_C534_4503_A197_67DA6AB13F39
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 373269e44959147d53a02d5395474183916a5a90d5ae11850a52bba480160711
#. default-sha256: 0ebecf97253fe38240f93d8e1ac8a109fff9361e5bdfcc7afb6263a90f367c0a
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_728DAE21_C534_4503_A197_67DA6AB13F39"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The more time that passed, the more I grew to question myself—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫my worth as a "
"human being."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫나는 시간이 갈수록 ⟪k:1⟫비굴해져서―― 내 가치를 믿기 힘들어졌다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_05DCCE77_2C9B_446E_A26A_9A2D2037DAA0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b34def27776e4d97361af2ee8ea0c5f56ce709b5d74ea90c10bfe512349961cd
#. default-sha256: 6b01157e47ddb018fe688d0f4cbf2219b17e474c9723a0f74ae644458f7dbd28
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_05DCCE77_2C9B_446E_A26A_9A2D2037DAA0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And whenever the self-doubt and -loathing became too much to take...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I trekked up "
"to the top of the observation tower to see the light."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫자기부정과 자기혐오로 무너질 것 같을 때마다……⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫감시탑에 올라가 ⟪k:3⟫빛을 확인했다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_D9A599E4_1F98_4751_8132_4181FBE29AA6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3f0f10f30424df07ec756994873320e4847f1c9fa563cde0ec4573f6abfa4274
#. default-sha256: 64b9b424c4a17cb483b6cf4c5d30bef8000fd6d736f41a63cbb4fe47188cd09f
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_D9A599E4_1F98_4751_8132_4181FBE29AA6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Sitting there on the hard floor, I would place my hand on the skeleton’s leg, its "
"shoulder, its hand. ⟪k:2⟫From the size of the bones, whoever it was appeared to have still been "
"young when their life withered away."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫그리고 ⟪k:2⟫나보다 먼저 죽은 백골 시체와 접했다.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫그건 ⟪k:5⟫뼈의 크기로 추정컨"
"대 ⟪k:6⟫아직 아이 같았다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_4ECEF7B3_D973_4233_85E1_87C934AF2AA4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b304ead25cec14345f49deb7430fc9f10f36f1bd5de64c277d8fa35aa1c72b01
#. default-sha256: 3302af957925e680e904ed46b98a8cc4be0bce0a712877432c38e6c973c16db8
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_4ECEF7B3_D973_4233_85E1_87C934AF2AA4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Poor child."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫처량하구나."

#: scenario7:scenario7_ABA3EF0D_6DD3_46A7_A76A_8ABEA1DCD8A8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4f34050ef7d43849b60733323a89cc82e7f4fa2f6e3dcb88dfedb71c7557b390
#. default-sha256: 36df629bb7b9dcff57dac8d67cfc1f22b4251dd3d72fe7353af249606af65f54
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_ABA3EF0D_6DD3_46A7_A76A_8ABEA1DCD8A8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Even I feel blessed... ⟪k:1⟫compared to you."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫너는 나보다…… 처량해."

#: scenario7:scenario7_1044E7B9_BCB3_4E2A_B1D2_004CBC09D103
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b5b359e6cc50eae7d9b46a6847773532da1b844a3af3233492148fa3457561fd
#. default-sha256: 13a6a82877c357a5cc049dec482f882b58ea45ae1acfd973335621ebc50818e7
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_1044E7B9_BCB3_4E2A_B1D2_004CBC09D103"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Oh, how miserable it must have been, locked away up in this tower... ⟪k:1⟫To have your arm "
"mercilessly severed..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫이런 데 갇혀 살아서 ⟪k:1⟫많이 괴로웠겠지…….⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫이렇게 팔이 절단돼서 ⟪k:4⟫많이 아팠겠"
"지……."

#: scenario7:scenario7_435D196C_FC86_482D_888C_DCE33D0A36D7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c47efabb5493964e98942a8d9ddeb4371c9d0409cf044d7ef761344685c03edb
#. default-sha256: 0799ada94bd065b1c76f90b80ab1aece82dcc3c4fbbbec213ef25a1fbb5ed2fe
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_435D196C_FC86_482D_888C_DCE33D0A36D7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You have my pity, though."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫내가…… ⟪k:2⟫너를…… ⟪k:3⟫불쌍히 여길게……."

#: scenario7:scenario7_CADE1978_894F_4C1B_AB07_9C71BA262DE4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: da43cba34c8658f2dfe6377b82583e8101c7cad34fd7d184c483e5c91ec7ba9d
#. default-sha256: e14090ccea1c7fca68a47d476987c0cc634d401f033df8e586bd005bf3898994
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_CADE1978_894F_4C1B_AB07_9C71BA262DE4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I alone shall mourn your death..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫나만이…… ⟪k:1⟫네 죽음을 슬퍼할게……."

#: scenario7:scenario7_C7F4B452_3CA5_46CA_949D_B73906C73C27
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b8090aa5b1766be95926071716fbd23a7e986f2bad0596fa0a0bc0255ca5d5d6
#. default-sha256: 2415e46c7f54534c00c52693c5fa24a9857d2c5254a1a2c430bae2ca9ac4c859
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_C7F4B452_3CA5_46CA_949D_B73906C73C27"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And I alone shall take comfort in your presence..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫나만이…… ⟪k:1⟫너를 필요로 할게……."

#: scenario7:scenario7_96B56A77_61D9_4AA0_BFE4_6796DF8CC00E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c8f516000203b8ef90e4c5dfeba501b34bc04a9f68255d77e530ffd1dee0d423
#. default-sha256: 5d106d886250e0b75d7aa8e9babfc622a6dbc352f7d8d4c413275e9933ba25c6
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_96B56A77_61D9_4AA0_BFE4_6796DF8CC00E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You poor, poor child..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……딱한 아이구나……."

#: scenario7:scenario7_BF1AC9D6_9718_4DAF_BFD3_48556B9C60B1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0a5a36787da5cf848d502d4836cf35fade4a6de334c6647e262c7fb9db81a112
#. default-sha256: ae8bdcf2c1c7f5d634f5954732ba8a14d134c5009269af2af2aa8ac379fc4923
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_BF1AC9D6_9718_4DAF_BFD3_48556B9C60B1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫By pretending to pity someone who had had it worse than me,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I was able to feel "
"somewhat better about myself."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫나는 나보다 처량한 존재를 자애롭게 대하는 척하며――⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫그나마 ⟪k:3⟫내가 낫다는 ⟪k:4⟫자기"
"위로에 빠졌다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_D6E3C3D0_3678_4356_9740_08C969B3AC41
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d2a251189d105daf6707ed5c30b91fe74e20587170db62455c4303eb52c92e34
#. default-sha256: 5b1f1b10c29ff1bf24e5f5543c773d907203782de00ffcb7b6d1a30ce9ae9d84
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_D6E3C3D0_3678_4356_9740_08C969B3AC41"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Because if I was in a position to pity someone else..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫내가 아직은 ⟪k:1⟫남을 동정할 입장이고……"

#: scenario7:scenario7_394AC233_87A7_4B95_AC22_51DFA34BE575
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b98c7594e0804a18b8abaf872e3088ead2b3940b2d41fc07fc125bb5d0ad73f0
#. default-sha256: b452fdc935537853247f9f2a2ed611d119f9435b32857d31d67edcd569eef48e
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_394AC233_87A7_4B95_AC22_51DFA34BE575"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫then, conversely, I wasn’t in a position to be pitied."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫동정받을 입장이 아니라 여겼다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_5A62B01D_C5D7_479F_B57A_FA5817CCAE90
